{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54459","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诸属幕，必（京本作「须」）是选贤（辛本、川本作「堪」、京本作「沉」）良。\n勿取（京本作「使」）门高（京本作「风」）当势位，无私亲旧与乡邦（京本作「同乡」）。\n曲顺（京本作「邪曲」）定爲殃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54459.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54459","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}